    if (std::popcount(opFlags) != 1)
```

`sfRemainingOwnerCount` is never restored on item deletion — the `adjustment > 0` guard skips the decrement path, so pre-funded sponsor quota permanently leaks on every sponsored object deletion.

Change the guard to run for both creation and deletion:

```suggestion:-9+1
        auto sponsorObjSle = view.peek(keylet::sponsorship(sponsorID, accountID));
        if (sponsorObjSle)
        {
            // update the pre-funded RemainingOwnerCount on Sponsorship ledger object
            // Remaining owner count moves opposite to adjustment:
